<title>USA: AccuStaff acquires Blackstone Group.</title>
<headline>AccuStaff acquires Blackstone Group.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said Friday it acquired Blackstone Group, which provides software consulting services to the information technology business community.</p>
<p>Blackstone, which is expected to have 1996 revenues in excess of $20 million, will become part of AccuStaff's professional services division.</p>
<p>AccuStaff announced in August an agreement for Career Horizons Inc to be merged into AccuStaff, creating the fourth largest staffing company in the U.S.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
